OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FElizabeth Alker presents
OL,12,     Fhighlights from the BBC Proms,
OL,13,     Fincluding Shostakovich's 10th
OL,14,     FSymphony from the BBC Symphony
OL,15,     FOrchestra and highlights from the
OL,16,     FEdinburgh Festival.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mendelssohn
OL,18,     F5/5. Kate Molleson follows
OL,19,     FMendelssohn's homecoming and his
OL,20,     Fsearch for a lasting musical
OL,21,     Flegacy.
